Description: DEEPX Runtime Library (pre-built binary package)
 DEEPX Runtime (DXRT) library for running neural network inference
 on DEEPX NPU hardware.
 .
 This is the binary distribution of libdxrt. Unlike the source package
 (libdxrt) which compiles on the target machine during installation,
 this package ships pre-built shared libraries, CLI tools, headers, and
 (optionally) a pre-built dx_engine Python wheel. Install time is fast
 and no compiler toolchain is required on the target.
 .
 python3 and python3-pip are listed under Recommends — they are only
 required when the package ships a dx_engine wheel under
 /usr/share/libdxrt-bin/python/. On Python-less servers the package
 installs cleanly and the wheel install step in postinst is skipped.

